* =====================================================================================================
* sleep_current__bss138dw.lib -- BSS138DW dual N-MOSFET (one half per instance), DC model with off leakage
*
* Part      : Diodes Inc. BSS138DW-7-F (base board Q1: Q1A pulls TS/MR low, Q1B pulls BTN_N low; gates on SW_GATE)
* Datasheet : https://www.diodes.com/assets/Datasheets/ds30203.pdf  (DS30203 Rev. 16 - 2)
*
* Modelled (Electrical Characteristics, TA = 25 C):
*   VGS(th) 1.2 V typ (0.5-1.5 V) -> level-1 VTO = 1.2 V
*   RDS(on) 1.4 ohm typ at VGS = 10 V -> KP = 1/(1.4 * (10 - 1.2)) = 0.081 A/V^2 (W = L = 1)
*   IDSS    <= 0.5 uA at VDS = 50 V, VGS = 0 (no typical): max corner only, applied at the actual VDS through
*           tanh (upper bound: the 50 V figure is used at 3.3 V).
*   MAXC = 0 typical, 1 datasheet maximum.
*
* NOT modelled: body diode, capacitances, temperature, gate leakage IGSS (+-100 nA at 20 V; gate sits at 0 V).
* =====================================================================================================
.subckt SC_BSS138 d g s params: MAXC=0
.param idss = {MAXC > 0.5 ? 0.5u : 0}
M1 d g s s NBSS138 L=1 W=1
Blk d s I = 'idss * tanh(v(d,s)/0.1)'
.model NBSS138 NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.2 KP=0.081)
.ends SC_BSS138
